	shape: "circle",
	text: [
		"By §6default§r, just placing the Incense Altar provides a §620% bonus§r. ",
		"",
		"To further improve this, blocks that provide tranquility need to be placed within the altars §6range§r. ",
		"",
		"To start out, place a §63x3§r of §6Wooden Path§r blocks in each §6cardinal§r direction of the altar, leaving §61 block gap§r between path and altar.",
		"",
		"Each \"ring\" of path blocks can be 1 block §6lower§r or §6higher§r than the previous one, as long as they match the §6same layout§r on all 4 sides.",
		"",
		"For example a pyramid shape would be valid.",
		"",
		"Now, blocks that provide §6tranquility§r can be placed inside the 3x3 §6corners§r between the paths.",
		"",
		"These can be placed on the §6same height§r as the path, as well as up to §62 blocks above§r."
	],
